   }
  },
  "93910733": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1871099126,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m not interested, okay? So you can save the card and your lines for someone else.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1880999512": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1871099126,
   "actor": "Stranger",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ah, playing hard to get, are we? I get it—",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-768732836": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1871099126,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No, you don’t get it. I said I’m not interested. So how about you ‘get’ that and move along?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "548494497": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1871099126,
   "actor": "Stranger",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Alright, alright. No need to be so harsh. Just thought I’d try my luck.",
